1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:03,940
Tonight, the lighthouse stops needing its keeper.

2
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:08,616
For 41 years, Elias climbed these steps at dusk.

3
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,740
Tomorrow, a machine takes over.

4
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:15,773
So tonight, he lights the lamp one last time.

5
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:27,305
Out at sea, a ship answers.

6
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:34,329
Two letters in Morse code: thank you.

7
00:00:35,550 --> 00:00:41,000
He watches the light turn, then walks home.
